  Slug: osprey-warrior
  DisplayName: Osprey Warrior
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "You'd always been the most athletic child of your play group, leading
    the other children in games of skill and strategy. As an adult, there are few
    opportunities for you to employ these skills in the village. Osprey Cove is a
    quiet community, with hardly any dangers or foes to fight. You occasionally break
    up pub brawls, or perhaps start them out of boredom. Elder Ordwi asks you to
    come with her simply because of your endurance and athleticism\u2014the Old Coast
    Road is poorly maintained, and the physical aid you'll bring on the trip will
    likely be invaluable. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or
    Constitution , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Athletics
    skill and the Gorum Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hefty
    Hauler] skill feat."
  SourceTitle: 'Pathfinder Adventure: Rusthenge'
